{
  "_about": "SeLop/LROR (arXiv:2601.11915) on MIDS. Frozen CLIP ViT-L/14-336 + per-layer LROR + linear head, plain CE. Defaults tuned for best accuracy per the paper (last-12-layer intervention, rank 32).",

  "clip_path": "base_models/clip-vit-large-patch14-336",
